{"3762610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mission Rumble", "steam_appid": 3762610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/9a85edc2d01dee44212a9b6cca5e5674.avif?t=1778834310\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to <i><strong>Mission Rumble</strong></i> – the wildest, most explosive 2D platform fighter you’ve never seen coming. Ditch the fancy footwork and forget martial arts – this battlefield runs on rocket launchers, M16s, baseball bats, and whatever insane weapon spawns next out of thin air!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/2342b526d86809f3e3209ee4fb0f0130.poster.avif?t=1778834310\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/2342b526d86809f3e3209ee4fb0f0130.webm?t=1778834310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/2342b526d86809f3e3209ee4fb0f0130.mp4?t=1778834310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/71103a9d3f719d391703db7c3ba37f66.avif?t=1778834310\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive into chaotic online brawls with friends or total strangers. Snatch up absurd weapons. Unleash total mayhem. Every match is a new surprise – and total carnage is just one trigger pull away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/7b6f75b3c1af45fcdc7baa0760ee93dd.avif?t=1778834310\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each round kicks off with random power-ups that flip the rules on their head. Become a walking tank. Make your enemies moonwalk to their doom. Or watch everyone grow hilariously huge brains for no reason at all. Strategy might help. Luck definitely will. Madness? Absolutely guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/fa393c3789265f681f7292722b806fe3.poster.avif?t=1778834310\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/fa393c3789265f681f7292722b806fe3.webm?t=1778834310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/fa393c3789265f681f7292722b806fe3.mp4?t=1778834310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Caution: May destroy friendships – and keyboards.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/9a85edc2d01dee44212a9b6cca5e5674.avif?t=1778834310\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to <i><strong>Mission Rumble</strong></i> – the wildest, most explosive 2D platform fighter you’ve never seen coming. Ditch the fancy footwork and forget martial arts – this battlefield runs on rocket launchers, M16s, baseball bats, and whatever insane weapon spawns next out of thin air!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/2342b526d86809f3e3209ee4fb0f0130.poster.avif?t=1778834310\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/2342b526d86809f3e3209ee4fb0f0130.webm?t=1778834310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/2342b526d86809f3e3209ee4fb0f0130.mp4?t=1778834310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/71103a9d3f719d391703db7c3ba37f66.avif?t=1778834310\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive into chaotic online brawls with friends or total strangers. Snatch up absurd weapons. Unleash total mayhem. Every match is a new surprise – and total carnage is just one trigger pull away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762610/extras/7b6f75b3c1af45fcdc7baa0760ee93dd.avif?t=1778834310\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each round kicks off with random power-ups that flip the rules on their head. Become a walking tank. Make your enemies moonwalk to their doom. Or watch ev